WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.311
Blood culture specimens may be rejected by the laboratory if they do not meet quality requirements.

2
00:00:07.311 --> 00:00:10.052
An unlabelled or improperly labelled specimen.

3
00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:11.880
A leaking culture bottle.

4
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.251
Inadequate blood volume.

5
00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:14.621
A broken bottle.

6
00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:17.363
Or use of an incorrect container.

7
00:00:17.363 --> 00:00:28.329
To avoid rejection, always ensure proper labelling, collect the recommended volume, and check that the bottles are intact before sending them to the laboratory.

